# Versification "Bible Strong NET": an overlay on bs-eng, for the NET Bible.
#
# 2 Corinthians 13 has 13 verses, as in org: NET 13:12 holds the holy kiss and the greeting of
# the saints, 13:13 the grace.
2CO 13:13
2CO 13:13 = 2CO 13:13
#
# Jonah 1 ends at 16: the published NET has no verse for org 2:1 (English 1:17, the great fish),
# and NET 2:1 ("Jonah prayed to the Lord his God from the stomach of the fish") is org 2:2, as
# in bs-eng.
JON 1:16
